            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 25–30</h3><p>What is the students’ opinion about each of the following food trends?</p><p>Choose <strong>SIX</strong> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <strong>A–H</strong>, next to Questions 25–30.</p><p><strong>Food trends</strong></p>",
